      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تسأّل</span></b> , in the modern language, signifies
<i>He begged,</i> or <i>asked alms;</i> as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَسَوَّلَ</span>: both
probably post-classical.]

